# Density Compare
# Terbium (Tb) — real density 8.23 g/cm³. equal masses: Terbium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Terbium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.9mm color: #c9ffa6 at (-20mm, 4.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 65.6 g — the water cube is the reference
